meta {
  name: 41 Trigger 2 - Partial Payment
  type: http
  seq: 16
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/payments
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

headers {
  content-type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "orderId": "{{norderId}}",
    "paidAmount": 400,
    "paymentMode": "CASH"
  }
}

docs {
  ▶ Fires `payment.received` → partial_payment_for_lab_order_inform_patient.
  Pays 400 (running total 500 of 1000), so the order stays partially paid and
  the PARTIAL feature is selected. Expect {amount} = 400.00,
  balance_amount = 500.00.

  NOTE (tenants that already have their own templates, e.g. priya): payment
  events dispatch tenant-wide (branchId = null), so they resolve to the tenant's
  existing tenant-level template, NOT the branch-level clone from request 24.
  To make THIS template render the tag body you must edit the tenant-level
  partial-payment template as a business_admin (see folder docs).
}
